separate from native engine renderer, procedural audio, input/UI, network authority.\\\\n- Six data-driven garden encounters; action-driven campaign proof and real network checks.\\\\n\\\\n## Validation\\\\nNot run yet.\\\\n'); print(slug)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Killer-Bee-Night-Killer-Bees-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-030123\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
