{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"agent_message","text":"The title draw selected **Killer Bee Night**. The engine and Hub SDK match the versions named in the plan. Research confirms the ray destroys rival swarms, while sustained contact defeats the gardeners and leaves obstacles behind. Simulation, networking, and audio work are underway in parallel.\n"}}
