{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_82","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > evidence/VISUAL-NOTES.md <<'EOF'\n# Inspected visual evidence\n\nThese screenshots establish composition and feedback. Automated authoritative checks, rather than screenshots, establish combat correctness and campaign completion.\n\n| Screenshot | Inspection |\n| --- | --- |\n| \"'`title-final.png`, `title-browser.png` | Randomized identity, large native menu focus, original bee mark, readable 10-foot typography |\n| `coop-final.png` | Two distinct swarms, Focus compression, charged/empty status, solid shells and lane footprints |\n| `bellkeeper-final.png` | Carried bell silhouette, exposed luminous core, readable opening prompt and finale garden palette; selected with developer stage tools |\n| `ray-final.png` | Dedicated controlled visual fixture: one horizontal ray crosses scenery and the friendly Focus swarm; on-row hunter removed, off-row hunter remains. Authoritative tests prove eligibility separately. |\n| `ending-final.png` | Ordinary-command seeded campaign reached a real ending; surviving bees gather visibly below the result panel, with Play again and Title |\n| `portrait-chromium.png`, `portrait-webkit.png` | Full arena visible, P2 status below native corner controls, independent ray button clear of wrapped touch hint |\n| `pause-browser.png`, `about-browser.png` | Native menu readability, large focus targets, scrollable credits and reachable Back |\n| `art-sheet.png` | Original procedural bee, two gardener families and carried-bell anatomy beside the palette; all painted with native pixel primitives/Blob motion |\n\nThe image choices were inspected with the image-view tool. Earlier `*-first.png` and `*-fixed.png` captures are retained as evidence of the canvas sizing defect and correction, not the final presentation.\nEOF\npython3 - <<'\"'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('README.md');s=p.read_text().replace('\"'`evidence/title-final.png`, `coop-final.png`, `bellkeeper-final.png`: inspected final composition.'\"','\"'`evidence/title-final.png`, `coop-final.png`, `bellkeeper-final.png`, `ray-final.png`, `ending-final.png`: inspected final composition; setup notes are in `evidence/VISUAL-NOTES.md`.'\"');p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncmp vendor/engine/my-3d2dge.js vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js\nsha256sum ../Killer-Bee-Night-Killer-Bees-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-030123.html\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,pathlib\nj=json.loads(pathlib.Path('../exit-interview.json').read_text());print('Interview:', j['aiHub']['name'],';',j['testingFeedback'][0])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
